{"id": "1971211", "name": "מקסימום, מינימום, גבול עליון וגבול תחתון של סדרה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_V5\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:10px;\">מקסימום, מינימום וגבולות חלקיים</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:3px;\">הבחנה בין ערכי קיצון של הסדרה לבין הגבולות החלקיים</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:16px;\"><div>תהא הסדרה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px;margin:8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle x_n=\\frac{\\left(-1\\right)^n}{n}+\\frac{1+\\left(-1\\right)^n}{{{CT:0}}}\\)</div>\n<div>חשבו את ארבעת הגדלים הבאים.</div></div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:16px;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n<thead><tr style=\"background:#F5F1F8;color:#4b1f6f;\"><th style=\"padding:10px;\">גודל</th><th style=\"padding:10px;\">ערך</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody><tr><td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #D9D1DD;text-align:center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\max\\{x_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</td>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #D9D1DD;text-align:center;\">[[input:ans1]]<div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid #EEECEF;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#665f6b;margin-bottom:4px;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;text-align:center;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></td></tr><tr><td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #D9D1DD;text-align:center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\min\\{x_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</td>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #D9D1DD;text-align:center;\">[[input:ans2]]<div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid #EEECEF;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#665f6b;margin-bottom:4px;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;text-align:center;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></td></tr><tr><td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #D9D1DD;text-align:center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\overline{\\lim}x_n\\)</td>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #D9D1DD;text-align:center;\">[[input:ans3]]<div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid #EEECEF;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#665f6b;margin-bottom:4px;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;text-align:center;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div></td></tr><tr><td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #D9D1DD;text-align:center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\underline{\\lim}x_n\\)</td>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #D9D1DD;text-align:center;\">[[input:ans4]]<div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid #EEECEF;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#665f6b;margin-bottom:4px;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;text-align:center;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border:1px solid #EEECEF;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#665f6b;\">כל אחד מארבעת הערכים מזכה ברבע מן הניקוד.</div></div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_V5\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:10px;\">פתרון</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:3px;\">הפרדה לזוגיים ולאי־זוגיים</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:16px;\"><p>אם \\(\\displaystyle n\\) אי־זוגי, אז</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x_n=-\\frac1n\\)</p>\n<p>תת־סדרה זו שואפת ל-\\(\\displaystyle 0\\) מלמטה, והערך הקטן ביותר שלה מתקבל ב-\\(\\displaystyle n=1\\): \\(\\displaystyle x_1=-1\\).</p>\n<p>אם \\(\\displaystyle n\\) זוגי, אז</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x_n=\\frac1n+\\frac{2}{{{CT:0}}}\\)</p>\n<p>תת־סדרה זו יורדת אל \\(\\displaystyle \\frac{2}{{{CT:0}}}\\), והערך הגדול ביותר שלה מתקבל ב-\\(\\displaystyle n=2\\):</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x_2=\\frac12+\\frac{2}{{{CT:0}}}\\)</p>\n<p>לכן</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\max x_n={{CT:1}},\\quad \\min x_n={{CT:2}}\\)</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\overline{\\lim}x_n={{CT:3}},\\quad \\underline{\\lim}x_n={{CT:4}}\\)</p></div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "limit", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correct_answer_sup", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.25, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">המקסימום נכון.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">המקסימום אינו נכון.</p>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "correct_answer_inf", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">המינימום נכון.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">המינימום אינו נכון.</p>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "correct_answer_limsup", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-3-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">הגבול העליון נכון.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-3-F", "feedback": "<p dir=